$[Import* std]
`λ` spells the lambda head as `^` does, for plain, recursive, and zero-argument lambdas.
$[# {square x} {* x x}]
$[# fact {λ self {n} {!if {= n 0} 1 {* n {self {- n 1}}}}}]
${square 4} ${fact 5} ${map {' 1 2} {λ {x} {+ x 1}}} ${{λ {} 42}}
expect: 16
expect: 120
expect: [2, 3]
expect: 42
